{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>已故富商霍英東二房孫女霍詠盈（Caroline）2021年11月與吳婉芳長子胡智略（Caspar）結婚，兩人門當戶對、郎才女貌，婚後不時在社交平台放閃，羨煞旁人。日前適逢兩人結婚5周年「木婚」紀念日，霍詠盈在社交平台曬出多張甜蜜合照，更撰長文公開兩人如偶像劇般的浪漫愛情故事，大讚老公「美貌看不厭」！</p><figure><img alt=\"霍英東二房孫女霍詠盈（Caroline）2021年11月與吳婉芳大仔胡智略（Caspar）結婚。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220428/596389317006331904392075.jpeg/8pv6047C7oPe3ToKIlAeex8rMxIkunWr09RTz9PUU88\"/><figcaption>霍英東二房孫女霍詠盈（Caroline）2021年11月與吳婉芳大仔胡智略（Caspar）結婚。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郎才女貌成為一時佳話。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240628/883432688571125760092736.jpeg/tkOAzbMo3bWigp8sb9aC2dZbKNW4CnmMAj-dwAI_ncA\"/><figcaption>郎才女貌成為一時佳話。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郎才女貌。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144769532170240781269.jpeg/SToji8YaJe9Oa8PTGelqFIjp69LC0IFMwcFo9MHBaPQ\"/><figcaption>郎才女貌。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"登對！（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085650187499606016670593.jpeg/s_6BM0P7QM75WRklbzhJN7uw9C7aifARPmxpZD5saWQ\"/><figcaption>登對！（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><p>霍詠盈自爆中學時期係「剋星」　與胡智略倫敦地鐵車廂重逢</p><p>從霍詠盈分享的照片可見，兩人換上多套情侶裝拍攝型格寫真，當中更有一張兩人早年的青澀自拍舊照，見證多年感情變化。霍詠盈在長文中揭開兩人由中學同學發展成夫妻的偶像劇式緣分：「中學的我們，大概是大家最討厭的剋星，循規蹈矩音樂風紀 vs 痞帥淘氣體育生。長大後居然會在倫敦地鐵車廂內重逢，這種短劇才會出現的橋段，是你我現實裏的緣分。」</p><figure><img alt=\"情侶寫真。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144772543811584305962.jpeg/FI0qGjeVlQB7hV2923LVoBIn_jZoZfJUg0OdxINDncQ\"/><figcaption>情侶寫真。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好登對。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144766604414976801296.jpeg/yrJmcsJfwPha408SD-jv7kOl0GxOH0iNWgj-IloI_iI\"/><figcaption>好登對。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"結婚5周年。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144743322095616435091.jpeg/Fk8i-coBbca3GAdHzKA8qV_f8T-jvDcJBWHyAQVh8gE\"/><figcaption>結婚5周年。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sweet！（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144746354708480642138.jpeg/1Rn6gyJBoRt-GfdovDo-L3VIY1n6WE0l_cmMDP3JjAw\"/><figcaption>Sweet！（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青澀舊照。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144749110497280572140.jpeg/K5XAAOn989-M5uMouTcZ2oqW6wED8ck5d5b0AneW9AI\"/><figcaption>青澀舊照。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><p>霍詠盈幽默放閃大讚老公美貌看不厭　承諾攜手走過下一個五十年</p><p>除了回味重逢經過，霍詠盈亦感性感謝胡智略五年來的包容與支持，更大讚老公顏值超高：「我不知道世上有沒有天生一對的戀人，但愛情能開花結果，是極度倚賴天時地利人和，維繫感情更是靠兩個人共同努力、進步、肯溝通，能成為彼此無所不談的best friend，實屬難得。謝謝你愛我、保護我、了解我，在我發脾氣前總能洞察先機並循循化解，謝謝你從來沒有嘗試改變我，總是支持我，想當女強人或當個小孩子亦可。也謝謝你那看不厭的美貌，讓我五年來每天對住你，潛移默化地變美 🤣（至少能帶著姨母笑忍受你的weaponised incompetence）我愛五年前的你，愛現在的你，會繼續愛五年後的你，期待我們以後的五年、十年、五十年。Happy Anniversary to my favourite person in the world with his favourite person in the world 😚#CazgotWooed #Anniversary」</p><figure><img alt=\"合拍。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250114/955898003271454720215609.jpeg/T_Tqyy3jn1r4QLdcm9l8qnq7r24ZHfb8nBHDfZwRw30\"/><figcaption>合拍。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241226/948939284021514240703468.jpeg/da3mbbEngP4dxr0vszAIiEvv9DVQtxXzVE4g8lROIPI\"/><figcaption>性感。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"浪漫。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241226/948939278728040448219786.jpeg/ttbdw_rxApzE3p6J9YDmnrUW1ky3F6UMPj7ZaD4-2Wg\"/><figcaption>浪漫。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"霍詠盈身穿黑色透視晚裝。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241225/948664407016607744206374.jpeg/0wJZXf1TyYJ7tj53DjBtSRgI6ZM7Q5mhCXioeQl4qHk\"/><figcaption>霍詠盈身穿黑色透視晚裝。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大讚老公！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250124/959597896615858176470612.jpeg/1u9o48A13c7MtWfolJONlD7j6rlk1Gs0VtIa11bSGtc\"/><figcaption>大讚老公！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>胡智略霍詠盈出身顯赫門當戶對　豪門學霸夫妻堪稱絕配</p><p>霍詠盈與胡智略同樣出身富裕，霍詠盈爸爸霍文遜是著名外科醫生，她也是一名高材生，畢業於英國皇家藝術學院建築系碩士。而胡智略是前港姐亞軍吳婉芳與富豪老公胡家驊的大仔，曾就讀香港華仁書院及英國哈羅公學，並以一級榮譽的成績畢業於倫敦大學經濟系，之後繼續修讀碩士學位。胡智略同霍詠盈這對姊弟戀一向低調，但2021年舉行婚禮時亦成為城中熱話！</p><figure><img alt=\"出身豪門。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241225/948663823869939712493625.jpeg/eLXkibVqOcIYcBdBunMX_hyDsh1D0wUUQoNKr0KDSq8\"/><figcaption>出身豪門。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"門當戶對。（IG@carolinefwy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200146018067288064358269.jpeg/5D7OU5KN07BkwlBTVTTAo_0As6YuY30p2zHgKdsx4Ck\"/><figcaption>門當戶對。（IG@carolinefwy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085650197205618688326081.jpeg/JJXHPmDpVnvjD7KigCr0zTgRg6_59OuO4HYRVOB2EVQ\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好登對。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250124/959597899770105856395462.jpeg/czV5UJdTYD6mCXNkTBiWmEP0t8gjxFfRTObN5EzmzeQ\"/><figcaption>好登對。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起跑馬拉松。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144741145120768702631.jpeg/Bnx0VqXo2Q5aju2UsKTncxQQYZFM2R6DyZfdJMmX3SQ\"/><figcaption>一起跑馬拉松。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一起跑馬拉松。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200144738968145920108397.jpeg/XyKsxTs5J_sBDXVdD8gJPbEmpFj_QYi9a3xx1mt8cdY\"/><figcaption>一起跑馬拉松。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.434961+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1417,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:30:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:19.859807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:50:08.502621+00:00","content_hash":"8378f2194a5b416a9600ca45349cf7125e210c512b1e3c80ed8c26c301cc52fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}